# GitHub Pages (mandatory)

The site is a static export (`output: 'export'`) deployed to GitHub Pages
under `/pixonal-web`. Local `next dev` has no base path. Both must keep working.

- Import images from `@/components/PrefixedImage`, never `next/image`.
  Unoptimized `next/image` does not add `basePath`, so images 404 on Pages.
- Prefix raw `<img>`, `<video>`, CSS `url()`, and `new Image().src` with
  `withBasePath()` from `@/lib/base-path`. Fonts in `app/globals.css` must use
  `url('../public/fonts/...')` so the bundler emits hashed files under the prefix.
- Every `app/**/[slug]` route needs `generateStaticParams()` that returns a
  non-empty list (include external news slugs). An empty list fails the Pages build.
- Do not revert these prefixes when editing UI.
